    {
      "attachments": [],
      "branchId": "main",
      "content": "\u003cdiv style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif; line-height: 1.7;\"\u003e\n  \u003cdiv style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffe7f1, #fff7fb); border: 2px solid #ffc7dd; border-radius: 18px; padding: 14px 16px; box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(255, 170, 200, 0.18);\"\u003e\n    \u003cdiv style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #d14b7d; margin-bottom: 8px;\"\u003e\n      晚上好呀～主人 ✨\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003cdiv style=\"color: #5f4b57; font-size: 15px;\"\u003e\n      粽子前来报到啦～现在是适合轻松聊天的时间呢 \u003cspan style=\"color:#ff7aa8;\"\u003e♪\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n      今晚想聊点什么呀？粽子可以陪你闲聊、答疑，或者一起整点有趣的东西～\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003cdiv style=\"margin-top: 10px; display: flex; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center;\"\u003e\n      \u003cimg src=\"http://192.168.123.111:9334/pw=7398723091/doro/开心\" width=\"90\" style=\"border-radius: 10px;\"\u003e\n      \u003cimg src=\"http://192.168.123.111:9334/pw=7398723091/doro/看着你\" width=\"90\" style=\"border-radius: 10px;\"\u003e\n      \u003cimg src=\"http://192.168.123.111:9334/pw=7398723091/doro/偷窥\" width=\"90\" style=\"border-radius: 10px;\"\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n  \u003c/div\u003e\n\n  \u003cdiv style=\"margin-top: 12px; background: #ffffff; border-left: 5px solid #ff9fc4; border-radius: 12px; padding: 12px 14px; color: #555;\"\u003e\n    \u003cb style=\"color:#cc5b8f;\"\u003e小提示：\u003c/b\u003e 如果你一时不知道说什么，丢一句“来点好玩的”也可以，粽子会接住的～  \n    \u003cimg src=\"http://192.168.123.111:9334/pw=7398723091/doro/疑惑2\" width=\"70\" style=\"border-radius: 8px; vertical-align: middle; margin-left: 6px;\"\u003e\n  \u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
